utput, labels, and the response — now reads at one consistent size instead of jumping between sizes.\n```\n\nInspected `/Users/malico/desgn/oga/CHANGELOG.md` using `oga query \"CHANGELOG.md Unreleased heading\"` and `rg -n '^## ' CHANGELOG.md && sed -n '/^## Unreleased$/,/^## /p' CHANGELOG.md`. No files changed.",
